Package: OpenPVA
Title: Open, Modular Population Viability Analysis Framework
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Barry", "Brook", email = "bwbrook@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Barry Brook [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Barry Brook <bwbrook@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: A general-purpose, open-source R framework for population viability analysis. It enables transparent, modular modeling of population dynamics under demographic, genetic, environmental, and management scenarios.
